  "ruleText": "Env-Or 409.01 Applicability. An owner who wishes to obtain a waiver from any rule in this chapter shall request a waiver as specified in Env-Or 409.02.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Or 400) #10393, eff 9-1-18; ss by #12643, eff 10-10-18 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Or 400)",
